<title>USA: Abraxas stock seen undervalued - report.</title>
<headline>Abraxas stock seen undervalued - report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Abraxas Petroleum Corp are seen as undervalued, according to a report in Business Week.</p>
<p>According to the magazine, Jefferies &amp; Co analyst C. Van Levy said Abraxas' net asset value is $13.50 a share and that the stock is currently trading at 57 percent of its liquidation value.</p>
<p>Abraxas stock closed at unchanged at $7.00 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
